<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Falcina Archive</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg-void:#0a0710;
    --bg-panel:#120c1e;
    --bg-panel-2:#171025;
    --purple-deep:#241a38;
    --purple-mid:#3d2a5c;
    --purple-glow:#8b6fc7;
    --gold:#c9a961;
    --gold-bright:#e8cd8a;
    --ink:#e9e2f4;
    --ink-dim:#a89bc4;
    --ink-faint:#6f6288;
    --line:#3a2e52;
  }

  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}

  body{
    background:var(--bg-void);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
    min-height:100vh;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }

  /* ambient starfield */
  .stars{
    position:fixed;inset:0;
    pointer-events:none;
    z-index:0;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 10% 20%, rgba(232,205,138,.5), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 80% 10%, rgba(232,205,138,.4), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 60% 70%, rgba(232,205,138,.5), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 30% 85%, rgba(232,205,138,.35), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 90% 60%, rgba(232,205,138,.4), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 45% 40%, rgba(232,205,138,.3), transparent);
    background-size:600px 600px;
    opacity:.5;
    animation:twinkle 6s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  @keyframes twinkle{from{opacity:.3}to{opacity:.6}}

  .app{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:272px 1fr;
    min-height:100vh;
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
  }

  /* ============ SIDEBAR ============ */
  .sidebar{
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg-panel),#0c0815);
    border-right:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:32px 22px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
  }

  .brand{
    text-align:center;
    padding-bottom:26px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .compass{
    width:88px;height:88px;
    margin:0 auto 14px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .compass svg{width:100%;height:100%;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(139,111,199,.55));}
  .brand h1{
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
    font-size:22px;
    letter-spacing:4px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .brand .sub{
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:6px;
    color:var(--gold);
    margin-top:4px;
  }

  nav{flex:1;}
  .nav-item{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
    padding:11px 14px;
    border-radius:6px;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    font-size:17px;
    letter-spacing:.4px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:background .2s, color .2s;
    user-select:none;
  }
  .nav-item:hover{color:var(--ink);background:rgba(139,111,199,.08);}
  .nav-item.active{
    color:var(--gold-bright);
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(139,111,199,.25), rgba(139,111,199,.05));
    box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(201,169,97,.25);
  }
  .nav-item .icon{width:18px;text-align:center;opacity:.9;}
  .nav-item .chev{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;transition:transform .25s;opacity:.7;}
  .nav-item.open .chev{transform:rotate(90deg);}

  .submenu{
    max-height:0;
    overflow:hidden;
    transition:max-height .3s ease;
  }
  .submenu.open{max-height:220px;}
  .sub-link{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
    padding:8px 14px 8px 38px;
    font-size:15.5px;
    color:var(--ink-faint);
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:color .2s;
  }
  .sub-link:hover{color:var(--gold-bright);}
  .sub-link .dot{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--purple-glow);flex-shrink:0;}

  .sidebar-foot{
    text-align:center;
    padding-top:18px;
    margin-top:18px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:13px;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    opacity:.6;
  }

  /* ============ MAIN ============ */
  main{padding:32px 40px 60px;}

  .hero{
    position:relative;
    border-radius:4px;
    padding:70px 40px 56px;
    text-align:center;
    overflow:hidden;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 120%, rgba(139,111,199,.35), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 78% 22%, rgba(232,225,244,.18), transparent 22%),
      linear-gradient(180deg,#1b1330 0%, #120c1f 55%, #0d0a16 100%);
  }
  .hero::before{
    /* skyline silhouette */
    content:'';
    position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:130px;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(0,0,0,.55) 60%, rgba(0,0,0,.85));
  }
  .hero .corner{
    position:absolute;width:34px;height:34px;
    border:1px solid var(--gold);
    opacity:.55;
  }
  .hero .corner.tl{top:10px;left:10px;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;}
  .hero .corner.tr{top:10px;right:10px;border-left:none;border-bottom:none;}
  .hero .corner.bl{bottom:10px;left:10px;border-right:none;border-top:none;}
  .hero .corner.br{bottom:10px;right:10px;border-left:none;border-top:none;}

  .hero-content{position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .hero-glyph{font-size:20px;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:14px;letter-spacing:8px;}
  .hero h2{
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
    font-size:56px;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:3px;
    color:#f4efff;
    text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(139,111,199,.6);
  }
  .hero-rule{
    width:220px;margin:20px auto;
    height:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--gold),transparent);
    position:relative;
  }
  .hero-rule::after{
    content:'✦';position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;
    transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    color:var(--gold);font-size:13px;
    background:#150f22;padding:0 8px;
  }
  .hero p{
    max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;
    font-style:italic;
  }

  /* ============ CARD GRID ============ */
  .grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:22px;
    margin-top:26px;
  }
  .grid.two{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}

  .card{
    position:relative;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:3px;
    overflow:hidden;
    min-height:200px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:flex-end;
    cursor:pointer;
    background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--bg-panel-2),#0c0815);
    transition:transform .3s ease, border-color .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease;
  }
  .card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-4px);
    border-color:var(--gold);
    box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.5), 0 0 0 1px rgba(201,169,97,.2);
  }
  .card-art{
    position:absolute;inset:0;
    opacity:.35;
    background-size:cover;background-position:center;
    transition:opacity .3s ease, transform .4s ease;
  }
  .card:hover .card-art{opacity:.5;transform:scale(1.04);}
  .card-scrim{
    position:absolute;inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,7,16,.15) 0%, rgba(10,7,16,.9) 78%);
  }
  .card-body{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:20px 22px;}
  .card-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .card-head .ci{font-size:20px;color:var(--gold);}
  .card-head h3{
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
    font-size:19px;letter-spacing:1.5px;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .card-head .rule{flex:1;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--line),transparent);}
  .card p{
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.5;
    max-width:88%;
  }

  .grid-tall .card{min-height:230px;}

  footer{
    text-align:center;
    margin-top:44px;
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:15px;
    letter-spacing:1px;
    font-style:italic;
    opacity:.75;
  }
  footer .glyph{color:var(--purple-glow);margin:0 14px;font-size:12px;}

  @media (max-width:900px){
    .app{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .sidebar{display:none;}
    .grid,.grid.two{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .hero h2{font-size:38px;}
    main{padding:20px;}
  }

  :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold-bright);outline-offset:2px;}

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    .stars{animation:none;}
    .card,.card-art{transition:none;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="stars"></div>

<div class="app">

  <!-- SIDEBAR -->
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="compass">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="46" fill="none" stroke="#c9a961" stroke-width="0.7" opacity="0.6"/>
          <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="38" fill="none" stroke="#8b6fc7" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.5"/>
          <path d="M50 8 L58 50 L50 92 L42 50 Z" fill="#e9e2f4" opacity="0.9"/>
          <path d="M8 50 L50 42 L92 50 L50 58 Z" fill="#8b6fc7" opacity="0.7"/>
          <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="4" fill="#c9a961"/>
          <path d="M50 2 L52 8 L50 14 L48 8 Z" fill="#c9a961"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h1>FALCINA</h1>
      <div class="sub">ARCHIVE</div>
    </div>

    <nav>
      <div class="nav-item active"><span class="icon">⌂</span> Home</div>

      <div class="nav-item" id="loreToggle"><span class="icon">📖</span> Lore <span class="chev">›</span></div>
      <div class="submenu open" id="loreMenu">
        <div class="sub-link"><span class="dot"></span> Timeline 01</div>
        <div class="sub-link"><span class="dot"></span> Timeline 02</div>
        <div class="sub-link"><span class="dot"></span> Timeline 03</div>
      </div>

      <div class="nav-item" id="kingdomToggle"><span class="icon">♛</span> Kingdoms <span class="chev">›</span></div>
      <div class="submenu open" id="kingdomMenu">
        <div class="sub-link"><span class="dot"></span> Chronvara</div>
        <div class="sub-link"><span class="dot"></span> Noctyra</div>
        <div class="sub-link"><span class="dot"></span> Astraelis</div>
        <div class="sub-link"><span class="dot"></span> Verdantia</div>
      </div>

      <div class="nav-item"><span class="icon">☺</span> Characters</div>
      <div class="nav-item"><span class="icon">🗺</span> World Map</div>
      <div class="nav-item"><span class="icon">🗄</span> Archives</div>
    </nav>

    <div class="sidebar-foot">✦ ✦ ✦</div>
  </aside>

  <!-- MAIN -->
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="corner tl"></div><div class="corner tr"></div>
      <div class="corner bl"></div><div class="corner br"></div>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-glyph">✦</div>
        <h2>Falcina Archive</h2>
        <div class="hero-rule"></div>
        <p>An archive dedicated to the land of Falcina—its forgotten histories, fallen kingdoms, and the echoes of time. Uncover the past. Understand the present. Prepare for what is yet to come.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="grid grid-tall">
      <div class="card" data-art="lore">
        <div class="card-art" style="background:radial-gradient(circle at 70% 30%, #4a3a6b, #120c1e 70%);"></div>
        <div class="card-scrim"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-head"><span class="ci">📖</span><h3>LORE</h3><span class="rule"></span></div>
          <p>Explore the timelines that shape the story of Falcina.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card" data-art="kingdoms">
        <div class="card-art" style="background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, #3d2a5c, #120c1e 70%);"></div>
        <div class="card-scrim"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-head"><span class="ci">♛</span><h3>KINGDOMS</h3><span class="rule"></span></div>
          <p>Discover the four kingdoms and the shades that rule over them.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card" data-art="characters">
        <div class="card-art" style="background:radial-gradient(circle at 60% 40%, #4a3a6b, #120c1e 70%);"></div>
        <div class="card-scrim"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-head"><span class="ci">☺</span><h3>CHARACTERS</h3><span class="rule"></span></div>
          <p>Meet the figures who leave their mark on Falcina's fate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid two" style="margin-top:22px;">
      <div class="card" style="min-height:170px;" data-art="map">
        <div class="card-art" style="background:radial-gradient(circle at 40% 50%, #5c4a2a, #120c1e 75%);"></div>
        <div class="card-scrim"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-head"><span class="ci">⛛</span><h3>WORLD MAP</h3><span class="rule"></span></div>
          <p>Traverse the lands of Falcina and uncover their secrets.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="min-height:170px;" data-art="archives">
        <div class="card-art" style="background:radial-gradient(circle at 65% 35%, #3d2a5c, #120c1e 75%);"></div>
        <div class="card-scrim"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-head"><span class="ci">🗄</span><h3>ARCHIVES</h3><span class="rule"></span></div>
          <p>Rare records, ancient texts, and hidden documents preserved through time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer>✦ &nbsp; Time remembers. The Archive endures. &nbsp; ✦</footer>
  </main>

</div>

<script>
  function toggleMenu(toggleId, menuId){
    const toggle = document.getElementById(toggleId);
    const menu = document.getElementById(menuId);
    toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
      toggle.classList.toggle('open');
      menu.classList.toggle('open');
    });
  }
  toggleMenu('loreToggle','loreMenu');
  toggleMenu('kingdomToggle','kingdomMenu');
</script>

</body>
</html>
